            "review_title": "Review at Sesan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mark R\n76 contributions\n0\nFantastic Vietnamese Dining Experience\nJul 2026 • Business\nSesan Restaurant was one of the highlights of our time in Ho Chi Minh City. The food was fresh, authentic, and beautifully presented. We especially enjoyed the local Vietnamese dishes, which were full of flavor and cooked perfectly. The staff were welcoming, attentive, and happy to recommend menu items.\n\nThe restaurant has a comfortable atmosphere that makes it suitable for both casual dinners and special occasions. Great food, excellent service, and good value for money. I would definitely return on my next visit to Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nWritten July 17, 2026",
