            "review_title": "Review at Sesan Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Konie L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nSesan - a good place to enjoy at night with romantic view\nAug 2013 • Couples\nAlmost the seafood restaurant i have gone in Ho Chi Minh city, i will see one thing that the space always small and stifling.But when i went to Sesan- a restaurant in Thu Duc district, my opinion be changed.\nThe first time i put my feet in here , i feel like i lost in jungle of Highlands, from the garden landscape with mountain river stone and a shrunk so warm yellow tone with brown wood background creating elegant and warm downs of restaurant.\nFollowed by a beautiful reception, she invited me upstairs to sit outside restaurants overview.\nOh at that time , I wish I did not go with my girlfriend , i would invite reception girl to sit together and have romantic night. Just kidding\nActually me and my girl friend have good night at there.\nThe food in Sesan is delicious , i enjoy seafood buffet with over 100 dishes.\nNext i have ordered one special redwine Lindemans Bin 95 sauvignon Blanc.\nWith the romantic place, why not!!!\nTotally,this is good place to enjoy for couple or family!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 7, 2013",
